WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:18.160
"I to find out what happened to Mayor Bloom!"

2
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:19.201
thought Roxy.

3
00:00:20.321 --> 00:00:21.341
She looked at her friends.

4
00:00:21.361 --> 00:00:25.542
"Hey, guys," said Roxy.

5
00:00:26.903 --> 00:00:28.763
"I forgot my lunch money.

6
00:00:29.584 --> 00:00:30.644
I'll meet you at school."

7
00:00:33.076 --> 00:00:35.178
"I can lend you some money," said Terrell.

8
00:00:36.059 --> 00:00:37.740
But Roxy was already gone.

9
00:00:42.805 --> 00:00:44.987
A moment later Roxy arrived at City Hall.

10
00:00:45.868 --> 00:00:47.349
But the building had disappeared!

11
00:00:47.369 --> 00:00:50.992
"This is really weird," thought Roxy.

12
00:00:51.012 --> 00:00:53.554
"I'd better find Detective Smith!

13
00:00:54.455 --> 00:00:56.637
Maybe he knows what's going on in Metro City."

14
00:00:57.938 --> 00:00:59.640
Roxy flew to Police Headquarters.

15
00:01:02.856 --> 00:01:03.056
"Oh no!"

16
00:01:03.076 --> 00:01:03.576
Roxy cried.

17
00:01:04.457 --> 00:01:05.697
That building was gone too.

18
00:01:10.959 --> 00:01:12.740
Girl!" a tiny voice called.

19
00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:16.922
"Huh?" Roxy looked around but didn't see anything.

20
00:01:16.942 --> 00:01:20.203
"That's strange," she thought.

21
00:01:20.223 --> 00:01:22.844
"I thought I heard someone say my name."

22
00:01:23.865 --> 00:01:26.746
The voice called out again, "Rocket Girl!

23
00:01:27.006 --> 00:01:28.166
I'm down here!"

24
00:01:29.387 --> 00:01:30.387
Roxy looked down.

25
00:01:30.407 --> 00:01:36.530
"Oh!" Detective Smith stood in the grass, next to a dandelion.

26
00:01:38.231 --> 00:01:39.791
He was about a centimeter tall.

27
00:01:40.392 --> 00:01:41.392
He didn't look happy.

28
00:01:42.513 --> 00:01:43.473
Roxy smiled.

29
00:01:44.234 --> 00:01:47.956
"It looks like you have a little problem, Detective Smith."

30
00:01:49.477 --> 00:01:50.777
Detective Smith frowned.

31
00:01:50.797 --> 00:01:53.819
"This isn't funny, Rocket Girl."

32
00:01:53.839 --> 00:01:57.101
"You're right," said Roxy.

33
00:01:57.121 --> 00:01:59.022
"Can you tell me what happened?"

34
00:02:00.122 --> 00:02:02.804
"We heard a strange sound," said the detective.

35
00:02:03.660 --> 00:02:07.781
"Police Headquarters began to shrink, and so did everyone inside.

36
00:02:08.561 --> 00:02:09.662
I jumped out a window.

37
00:02:10.602 --> 00:02:13.923
Then an enormous figure picked up the building and walked away!"

38
00:02:15.643 --> 00:02:16.824
Roxy scratched her head.

39
00:02:16.844 --> 00:02:20.525
"Metro City's new skyscraper shrank too.

40
00:02:21.385 --> 00:02:22.525
But it doesn't make sense.

41
00:02:23.525 --> 00:02:25.426
Why would someone shrink buildings?"

42
00:02:26.786 --> 00:02:29.107
"I don't know," said the detective.

43
00:02:29.127 --> 00:02:31.227
"But we need to find out.

44
00:02:31.868 --> 00:02:36.061
I can't stay like this for—" Suddenly there was a loud sound.

45
00:02:36.542 --> 00:02:39.884
Whirr! Roxy spun around.

46
00:02:40.544 --> 00:02:42.165
Another tall building was shrinking!

47
00:02:42.185 --> 00:02:44.727
"Uh-oh!" said Roxy.

48
00:02:45.468 --> 00:02:47.129
She looked down at Detective Smith.

49
00:02:47.149 --> 00:02:49.631
"You stay here, Detective.

50
00:02:50.331 --> 00:02:51.812
I'll find out what's going on!"

51
00:02:54.274 --> 00:02:55.755
Roxy flew over Metro City.

52
00:02:58.197 --> 00:02:59.397
She heard the sound again.

53
00:03:03.340 --> 00:03:03.680
Whirr! Whirr!

54
00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:05.441
Two more buildings shrank and disappeared!

55
00:03:08.321 --> 00:03:09.742
Roxy landed and looked around.

56
00:03:11.342 --> 00:03:12.903
She used her super hearing to listen.

57
00:03:12.923 --> 00:03:17.704
"Tee-hee!" "That sounds like a young girl giggling," thought Roxy.

58
00:03:17.724 --> 00:03:21.405
"The sound is coming from the other side of that parking garage."

59
00:03:22.605 --> 00:03:25.606
Roxy flew to the top of the parking garage and looked down.

60
00:03:27.267 --> 00:03:28.027
She gasped.

61
00:03:29.067 --> 00:03:31.768
A young girl in a space suit held a strange device.

62
00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:36.001
She pointed it at the bear statue.

63
00:03:37.982 --> 00:03:40.424
Whirr! The bear shrank!

64
00:03:44.006 --> 00:03:45.447
The girl put it in her pocket.

65
00:03:45.467 --> 00:03:48.829
"Whoa!" cried Roxy.

66
00:03:48.849 --> 00:03:52.811
"That young girl is shrinking things and taking them away!"
